        "updated_at": "2025-01-01T15:17:18Z",
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "body": "Hi, I'm reaching out to invite you to join an ongoing effort to share hypergraphs among many libraries and hopefully address this very old issue 🙂. Members of XGI, HypergraphX and HyperNetX have developed and implemented a standard in our respective libraries.\r\n\r\nI hope you would like to take a look at our repository where we provide the specification of a JSON format. It is an incidence-based encoding that looks to be compatible with the structure of the HyperGraph class in your package.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/pszufe/HIF-standard\r\n\r\nLet me know what you think and any way I can help make this happen!\r\n\r\nCheers and happy new year.",
