        "body": "Bumps the everything group with 23 updates in the / directory:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [@astrojs/markdown-remark](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/markdown/remark) | `6.0.0` | `6.0.1` |\n| [@astrojs/mdx](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx) | `4.0.1` | `4.0.3` |\n| [@astrojs/svelte](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/svelte) | `7.0.1` | `7.0.2` |\n| [@astrojs/tailwind](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/tailwind) | `5.1.3` | `5.1.4` |\n| [@astrojs/vercel](https://github.com/withastro/adapters/tree/HEAD/packages/vercel) | `8.0.0` | `8.0.1` |\n| [@fontsource/fira-mono](https://github.com/fontsource/font-files/tree/HEAD/fonts/google/fira-mono) | `5.1.0` | `5.1.1` |\n| [astro](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro) | `5.0.8` | `5.1.1` |\n| [shiki](https://github.com/shikijs/shiki/tree/HEAD/packages/shiki) | `1.23.0` | `1.24.4` |\n| [shiki-magic-move](https://github.com/shikijs/shiki-magic-move) | `0.3.7` | `0.5.2` |\n| [svelte](https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte/tree/HEAD/packages/svelte) | `5.2.1` | `5.16.0` |\n| [tailwindcss](https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss) | `3.4.15` | `3.4.17` |\n| [@eslint/js](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/tree/HEAD/packages/js) | `9.15.0` | `9.17.0` |\n| [@expressive-code/core](https://github.com/expressive-code/expressive-code/tree/HEAD/packages/@expressive-code/core) | `0.35.6` | `0.38.3` |\n| [@playwright/test](https://github.com/microsoft/playwright) | `1.48.2` | `1.49.1` |\n| [@types/node](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/node) | `20.17.6` | `22.10.3` |\n| [@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin](https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/tree/HEAD/packages/eslint-plugin) | `7.18.0` | `8.19.0` |\n| [eslint](https://github.com/eslint/eslint) | `9.15.0` | `9.17.0` |\n| [eslint-plugin-n](https://github.com/eslint-community/eslint-plugin-n) | `17.13.2` | `17.15.1` |\n| [eslint-plugin-promise](https://github.com/eslint-community/eslint-plugin-promise) | `7.1.0` | `7.2.1` |\n| [eslint-plugin-react](https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-react) | `7.37.2` | `7.37.3` |\n| [globals](https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals) | `15.12.0` | `15.14.0` |\n| [prettier](https://github.com/prettier/prettier) | `3.4.1` | `3.4.2` |\n| [typescript](https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript) | `5.6.3` | `5.7.2` |\n\n\nUpdates `@astrojs/markdown-remark` from 6.0.0 to 6.0.1\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases\"><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code>'s releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/6\"><code>@​6</code></a>.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12646\">#12646</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/f13417bfbf73130c224752379e2da33084f89554\"><code>f13417b</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! - Avoids parsing frontmatter that are not at the top of a file</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12570\">#12570</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/87231b1168da66bb593f681206c42fa555dfcabc\"><code>87231b1</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/GrimLink\"><code>@​GrimLink</code></a>! - Removes trailing new line in code blocks to prevent generating a trailing empty <code>&lt;span /&gt;</code> tag</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12664\">#12664</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a71e9b93b317edc0ded49d4d50f1b7841c8cd428\"><code>a71e9b9</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! - Fixes frontmatter parsing if file is encoded in UTF8 with BOM</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/main/packages/markdown/remark/CHANGELOG.md\"><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code>'s changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>6.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12646\">#12646</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/f13417bfbf73130c224752379e2da33084f89554\"><code>f13417b</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! - Avoids parsing frontmatter that are not at the top of a file</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12570\">#12570</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/87231b1168da66bb593f681206c42fa555dfcabc\"><code>87231b1</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/GrimLink\"><code>@​GrimLink</code></a>! - Removes trailing new line in code blocks to prevent generating a trailing empty <code>&lt;span /&gt;</code> tag</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12664\">#12664</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a71e9b93b317edc0ded49d4d50f1b7841c8cd428\"><code>a71e9b9</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! - Fixes frontmatter parsing if file is encoded in UTF8 with BOM</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/163cfd67f5c0faa2cfcbad932e61e25a1bffe0ee\"><code>163cfd6</code></a> [ci] release (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/markdown/remark/issues/12650\">#12650</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a71e9b93b317edc0ded49d4d50f1b7841c8cd428\"><code>a71e9b9</code></a> Fix frontmatter parsing with utf8 bom (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/markdown/remark/issues/12664\">#12664</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/f13417bfbf73130c224752379e2da33084f89554\"><code>f13417b</code></a> Only parse frontmatter at top of file (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/markdown/remark/issues/12646\">#12646</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/87231b1168da66bb593f681206c42fa555dfcabc\"><code>87231b1</code></a> Bugfix/extra whitespace in code (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/markdown/remark/issues/12570\">#12570</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commits/@astrojs/markdown-remark@6.0.1/packages/markdown/remark\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `@astrojs/mdx` from 4.0.1 to 4.0.3\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases\"><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code>'s releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code><a href=\"https://github.com/4\"><code>@​4</code></a>.0.3</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12799\">#12799</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/739dbfba4214107cf8fc40c702834dad33eed3b0\"><code>739dbfb</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/ascorbic\"><code>@​ascorbic</code></a>! - Upgrades Vite to pin esbuild</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code><a href=\"https://github.com/4\"><code>@​4</code></a>.0.2</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/f13417bfbf73130c224752379e2da33084f89554\"><code>f13417b</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/87231b1168da66bb593f681206c42fa555dfcabc\"><code>87231b1</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a71e9b93b317edc0ded49d4d50f1b7841c8cd428\"><code>a71e9b9</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/mark